tails-fine-0049"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:12e746ca0af50a94b185cdeddb40b56b2821d10e04c7372dbd38d881254bf569","title":"Can a conjectured restriction on sigma-model potentials constrain scalar actions with nonquadratic derivative dependence? The paper asks this for P(φ,X), where X = −(∂φ)²/2, and introduces an auxiliary-field extension to apply the geometric criterion.","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0052"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:1288be775a401e00e9577676de43619e10fb52fe48e9cf1887e2051df331c5f7","title":"Can inflationary fluctuations and quantum phase transitions probabilistically localize scanning fields near critical parameter values, thereby addressing Higgs near-criticality, Higgs naturalness, or a small cosmological constant?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0065"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:12fbdb05d6bad2faa16a98900dc9a4bcb6389b51191ba16380053b4db4c8055f","title":"Does the full discrete type IIB duality symmetry admit gauging on all allowed spacetime and duality backgrounds? The test concerns the quantum consistency of duality defects and background sums underlying the F-theory interpretation.","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0067"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:1205fd86ce3193f1937d91e3d557e575a09a3a7ab659bc07c079b0adaabbaaaa","title":"Can compactness, connectedness, and local field-theory data of small-instanton brane moduli reconstruct internal string geometries and establish the String Lamppost Principle for supersymmetric gravity in dimensions seven through nine, with an extension toward six dimensions?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0068"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:12c92d943c39ef452fb559ce154b377bec9d17b75db1e6177307ce585a1c7fcf","title":"How do cancellations in sector-averaged string degeneracies become cancellations in the physical one-loop cosmological constant, and what additional modular structure removes the remaining power-law divergences?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0069"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:129feab600525ad1f4b543b10adaa04db7e8f0134774a80e309e2bb167f7d240","title":"Can a matrix-tensor ensemble of approximate CFT2 data reproduce pure AdS3 gravity, including its sum over topologies, while imposing exact bootstrap constraints in a regulator limit?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0089"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:1250ebeed54952b26e25c8f332139d3b5fe4bc9bfc721c64241683ee0dc8e9d7","title":"How do axion–saxion kinetic coupling, gauge-mediated dissipation and thermal backreaction determine whether heterotic-motivated inflation is warm, effectively single-field or genuinely two-field?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0096"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:122537e3f613428d02fca124d66d1b911f97da9682067c0b5afd3e1d2e83d25d","title":"Can canonical quantization of EFT moduli yield a species quantum mechanics linking species number, tower mass variation, the asymptotic CRV pattern, dualities and Calabi–Yau period quantization?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0097"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:1213e00a2683350694097421a39bff85087934d8a6c8c8b5432c50a5334506e8","title":"Can energy-dependent rainbow corrections reconcile charged black-hole extremality, WGC particle bounds and WCCC, and produce distinguishable weak-lensing signatures?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0097"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:12c9e2ee6a646cc44f304bb2b32be1d053b1d65d6293e54e6f6e86112295a1e0","title":"How do metric and Palatini gravity change the connection between non-minimal scalar inflation, radiatively stable reheating, decay-produced fermionic dark matter and Type-I-seesaw non-thermal leptogenesis?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0099"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:12ed93f503af165a2e6b07144dd6fa00b6213e32a584405d47e465b596e64532","title":"Can complete gauge symmetry breaking by MSSM flat-direction condensates reconcile inflation with the conditional Festina Lente (FL) argument while enabling Affleck-Dine (AD) baryogenesis consistent with reheating and isocurvature constraints?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0102"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:128622e23dbd0a7aabb43506baba17e3b38181fb22558a0db701685bfbda855c","title":"How well can future CMB–galaxy correlations constrain the physical scale and amplitude of dark-energy clustering, and thereby test canonical single-scalar quintessence?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0103"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:12ff628092492d9400274c92ba759dd76d76f0d8f5ef1dc8883c8539616c4323","title":"Can a hyperbolic four-manifold with totally geodesic initial and final boundaries of different topology provide an explicit semiclassical topology-changing tunneling geometry in four-dimensional gravity with negative cosmological constant?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0105"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:12284c81c3ef37bb496d90713afb3243923988deaa1662eed765ce0996284a92","title":"How can the massless ten-dimensional gravitino interact consistently with nonsupersymmetric open-string matter in the USp(32) Type I string, and what leading low-energy action realizes the required consistency?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0108"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:127c72ec3df